OL,3,GNEWSAUK aid worker says he was mistaken
OL,4,Afor survivor in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British aid worker has spoken about
OL,7,Fbeing mistaken as a survivor of Nepal's
OL,8,Fflash floods, after it was incorrectly
OL,9,Fannounced he had been rescued.
OL,11,FAlastair Chambers, from Gloucester,
OL,12,Fsaid the mix-up happened when he
OL,13,Freturned to Kathmandu after flying back
OL,14,Fin a humanitarian aid helicopter from a
OL,15,Fvillage near the Trishuli river.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
