OL,3,GNEWSAUK aid worker says he was mistaken
OL,4,Afor survivor in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 45-year-old told the Press
OL,7,FAssociation: "I got dropped off at the
OL,8,Farmy barracks, and when I got dropped
OL,9,Foff one of the police officers came up
OL,10,Fto me and asked for my details. Then
OL,11,Fthey presumed that I'd been rescued.
OL,12,FIt's been a bit of a weird one,
OL,13,Freally."
OL,15,FOn Tuesday Nepal officials had
OL,16,Fannounced 119 people, including a
OL,17,FBritish man, had been rescued through
OL,18,Fthe use of air resources.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
